{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:00.36]Codeine guzzler, on another level (\n[00:03.06]DY Krazy\n[00:03.22])\n[00:03.28]Yeah, codeine guzzler, on another level\n[00:06.24]Bickin' back in the A’, sippin' on codeine like, \"Hey\"\n[00:08.92]Bitch, yeah\n[Chorus]\n[00:12.18]I'm a codeine guzzler, on another level\n[00:16.02]In a Tesla, rollin’ off a Tesla\n[00:19.08]Niggas tryna catch me lackin', get the best of me\n[00:22.56]But I got my hand on my Smith & Wesson\n[00:25.28]This a wave, I'm the ocean\n[00:28.02]Shorty like a slave, with my chains on\n[00:31.14]Percocet at the rave, get my rave on\n[00:34.24]Flyer than a ra-raven (Yeah)\n[Verse 1]\n[00:38.26]Countin' the riches, handlin' my business (Ooh, ooh)\n[00:41.30]Bitch you trippin', get out yo feelings (Ooh, ooh)\n[00:44.56]I been winning, winning and winning (Ooh)\n[00:47.14]Hop on my dick, bitch, like Tigger (Ooh)\n[00:48.70]I need a thick bitch, good figure\n[00:50.62]Wi-wi-wipe me down (Down, down, down)\n[00:54.30]Got it on me right now (Now, now, now)\n[00:56.86]Ask where I'm from, baby, I'm from Chi-Town (Town, town, town)\n[00:59.96]Five racks, whip it up, wipe it down (Down)\n[Chorus]\n[01:02.70]Codeine guzzler, on another level\n[01:05.88]In a Tesla, rollin’ off a Tesla\n[01:08.96]Niggas tryna catch me lackin’, get the best of me\n[01:12.44]But I got my hand on my Smith & Wesson\n[01:15.14]This a wave, I'm the ocean\n[01:17.86]Shorty like a slave, with my chains on\n[01:21.00]Percocet at the rave, get my rave on\n[01:24.14]Flyer than a ra-raven (Watch this)\n[Verse 2]\n[01:27.62]Birkin Bag (Uh-huh)\n[01:29.20]They gon’ stop and stare (Uh-huh)\n[01:30.26]Like, what you got in there? (Uh-huh)\n[01:32.30]None of your business (Uh-huh)\n[01:33.54]Half a brick to share (Uh-huh)\n[01:35.44]With my niggas (Uh-huh)\n[01:36.20]Got some swishers (Uh-huh), yeah, filled with killer (Yeah)\n[01:39.88]And a Beretta, it's ready to drill, yeah (Grrah)\n[01:41.70]Niggas say that they some killers\n[01:42.74]But they can't do it if they don't got a pill, yeah (Uh-uh)\n[01:44.74]Uh, peel ’em back like a Banana (Grrah, grrah, grrah, grrah, grrah)\n[01:46.52]Banana clip on me, the Draco is real, yeah\n[01:47.50]Shoot him twice, ask how him how does he feel, yeah (Grrah, grrah)\n[01:48.96]Make him eat the bullets like a happy meal, yeah (Yeah)\n[01:50.60]New watch cost damn near half a mill' (Gleam, yeah)\n[01:52.30]I can show you how to rap for real (Uh)\n[01:53.76]And I can show you how to trap for real (Bitch, trap)\n[01:55.38]I'm in the trap with the Raf's for real (Yeah, what else?)\n[01:56.86]With a nigga that'll shoot to kill (Grrah)\n[01:58.36]I know they feelin' me like I'm made of braille (Uh)\n[01:59.88]Keep talkin' brazy, then I send him to hell (Uh)\n[02:01.48]I'm off the Perc, it got me just like a snail (Uh)\n[02:02.92]If my nigga fight, I'm fighting like Holyfield (Yeah)\n[02:05.06]This shit right here is a show out (It's a show out)\n[02:08.00]Rich like a white bitch, yeah, I'ma show out (Uh-huh)\n[02:10.94]Amiri jeans, ass out (Oh)\n[02:12.72]I don't like to sag, but these money bags\n[02:14.90]Ain't givin' my belt a fuckin' chance (Let's go, let's go)\n[Chorus]\n[02:17.62]Codeine guzzler, on another level\n[02:20.70]In a Tesla, rollin' off a Tesla\n[02:23.76]Niggas tryna catch me lackin', get the best of me\n[02:27.26]But I got my hand on my Smith & Wesson\n[02:29.96]This a wave, I'm the ocean\n[02:32.66]Shorty like a slave, with my chains on\n[02:35.80]Percocet at the rave, get my rave on\n[02:38.92]Flyer than a ra-raven","words":[[0.36,0.72,"Codeine"],[0.78,1.14,"guzzler,"],[1.18,1.78,"on"],[1.84,2.24,"another"],[2.28,2.46,"level"],[2.48,2.58,"("],[3.06,3.08,"DY"],[3.12,3.2,"Krazy"],[3.22,3.24,")"],[3.28,3.46,"Yeah,"],[3.52,3.88,"codeine"],[3.94,4.42,"guzzler,"],[4.82,4.92,"on"],[4.98,5.38,"another"],[5.52,6.06,"level"],[6.24,6.52,"Bickin'"],[6.56,6.76,"back"],[6.84,6.9,"in"],[6.94,7.12,"the"],[7.2,7.26,"A’,"],[7.32,7.62,"sippin'"],[7.66,7.74,"on"],[7.82,8.34,"codeine"],[8